---

<Layout
  title="Inicio"
  description="Estudio de desarrollo de software en Mar del Plata. Diseñamos y construimos apps a medida para negocios reales. Más de 12 apps en producción."
  keywords="desarrollo de software, apps a medida, software para negocios, Mar del Plata, desarrollo web, apps de gestión, ERP"
>

  <!-- ═══ HERO ═══ -->
  <section class="aurora-bg hero-glow dot-grid relative min-h-[92vh] flex items-center" id="hero-section">
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 py-24 md:py-32">
      <!-- Badge -->
      <div class="anim-hero inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] text-slate-400 text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-full mb-8">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        Estudio de desarrollo · Mar del Plata, Argentina
      </div>

      <!-- Headline -->
      <h1 class="anim-hero-1 text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-6 max-w-4xl">
        Convertimos problemas<br/>
        <span class="gradient-text">en software que funciona</span>
      </h1>

      <!-- Subtitle -->
      <p class="anim-hero-2 text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        Diseñamos, construimos y acompañamos apps a medida para negocios que necesitan dejar de improvisar con Excel, WhatsApp y cuadernos.
      </p>

      <!-- CTAs -->
      <div class="anim-hero-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mb-16">
        <a href="#proyectos"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white text-[#050510] font-semibold px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors text-base">
          Ver proyectos
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 13.5L12 21m0 0l-7.5-7.5M12 21V3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/542236965481?text=Hola!%20Quiero%20saber%20más%20sobre%20sus%20servicios%20de%20desarrollo" target="_blank"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 text-slate-300 hover:text-white font-semibold px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all text-base">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
          Hablemos de tu proyecto
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <div class="anim-hero-4 flex flex-wrap gap-8 md:gap-12">
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white stat-number">12+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Apps construidas</div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-px h-12 bg-white/[0.06] hidden sm:block"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white stat-number">10</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Industrias</div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-px h-12 bg-white/[0.06] hidden sm:block"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black gradient-text-warm stat-number">100%</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Soporte directo</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Industry ticker -->
  <div class="border-y border-white/[0.04] bg-white/[0.015] py-4 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="marquee-track">
      {[...industries, ...industries].map(ind => (
        <span class="text-sm text-slate-500 whitespace-nowrap font-medium">{ind}</span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- ═══ SERVICIOS ═══ -->
  <section id="servicios" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="reveal mb-16">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-400 tracking-wide uppercase mb-3">Qué hacemos</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Software a medida, no genérico</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl">Cada proyecto se diseña desde cero para el rubro específico del cliente. No adaptamos plantillas — construimos exactamente lo que el negocio necesita.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      <div class="reveal reveal-d1 card p-7">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 1.5H8.25A2.25 2.25 0 006 3.75v16.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25h7.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 20.25V3.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H13.5m-3 0V3h3V1.5m-3 0h3m-3 18.75h3" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Apps de gestión</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Turnos, reservas, presupuestos, despacho, membresías. Apps diseñadas para rubros específicos, listas para usar desde el celular.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-d2 card p-7">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-violet-500/10 border border-violet-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20.25 6.375c0 2.278-3.694 4.125-8.25 4.125S3.75 8.653 3.75 6.375m16.5 0c0-2.278-3.694-4.125-8.25-4.125S3.75 4.097 3.75 6.375m16.5 0v11.25c0 2.278-3.694 4.125-8.25 4.125s-8.25-1.847-8.25-4.125V6.375m16.5 0v3.75m-16.5-3.75v3.75m16.5 0v3.75C20.25 16.153 16.556 18 12 18s-8.25-1.847-8.25-4.125v-3.75m16.5 0c0 2.278-3.694 4.125-8.25 4.125s-8.25-1.847-8.25-4.125" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">ERPs verticales</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Sistemas completos para operaciones complejas: distribución mayorista, administración inmobiliaria, gestión de obras.
        </p>
